<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 8.04 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 8.04 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.04 percent on Wednesday from 8.48 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market in seven reported transactions with a total value of 9.05 million dinars ($13 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
